we are launching our AI infrastructure strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/brookfield-bn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2025 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2025-11-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Goodman","x":"We also launched our seventh vintage flagship private equity fund focused on essential services and industrial businesses and are preparing to launch our inaugural AI infrastructure fund, which together will drive strong fundraising momentum going into 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/brookfield-bn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2025 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2025-11-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Goodman","x":"Recently, we announced new initiatives to advance next-generation power and AI infrastructure including our partnership with the U.S. government through Westinghouse to deliver $80 billion of new nuclear plants in the United States.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/brookfield-bn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2025 Q4","e":"bn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Goodman","x":"…with strong fundraising visibility, including the launch of our latest flagship private equity fund and our inaugural AI infrastructure fund, and with the announced acquisition of Oaktree, our asset management business is well positioned to deliver another year of meaningful earnings growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/brookfield-bn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2025 Q4","e":"bn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bruce Flatt","x":"As a result, we are now focused on streamlining and consolidating our market capitalization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/brookfield-bn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2025 Q4","e":"bn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bruce Flatt","x":"This will streamline our structure and enable the next evolution of Brookfield, bringing together our insurance and our balance sheet investment activities into one single entity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/brookfield-bn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q1","e":"bn","d":"2026-05-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas H. Goodman","x":"And I think for us, when you take a step back for Brookfield, our posture was with our relevance around AI infrastructure and our presence in the space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/brookfield-bn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q1","e":"bn","d":"2026-05-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas H. Goodman","x":"We were able to get ahead of what was coming. it is created a tremendous investment for our real asset strategies around AI, and with Oaktree's disciplined investment strategy and capabilities we think this could be an attractive investment opportunity for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/brookfield-bn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q1","e":"bn","d":"2026-05-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nicholas H. Goodman","x":"As part of our ongoing efforts to streamline our corporate structure, we are working toward combining the corporation on our Wealth Solutions business creating a fully integrated insurance and investment organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/brookfield-bn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q2","e":"bn","d":"2026-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sachin Shah","x":"We exited the early stage direct to consumer initiative and have been simplifying the organization around the areas where Just has an established track record and a real competitive advantage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/brookfield-bn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q2","e":"bn","d":"2026-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sachin Shah","x":"First, on the short term, I alluded to it in my comments around focusing the business, exiting some areas of the business that I would say were more early stage venture type initiatives, direct to consumer, other new lines of business that really just were not profitable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/brookfield-bn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q2","e":"bn","d":"2026-08-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas H. Goodman","x":"We retain a 64% interest in the business and will continue to participate in future value creation as demand for AI infrastructure accelerates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/brookfield-bn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q2","e":"bn","d":"2026-08-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nicholas H. Goodman","x":"And if the numbers are big right now, but we are, in our view, in the very early stages of what is a very significant investment cycle around AI digital and infrastructure and the whole power build out that is needed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/brookfield-bn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q2","e":"bn","d":"2026-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sachin Shah","x":"So that in and of itself is a cost reduction exercise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/brookfield-bn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2026-11-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Katie Battaglia","x":"Consumer spending remains healthy and significant investment in AI infrastructure continues to support economic growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/12/brookfield-bn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2026-11-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Katie Battaglia","x":"Today, we are seeing another significant evolution of the global economy driven by artificial intelligence and the enormous infrastructure required to support it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/12/brookfield-bn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2026-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Katie Battaglia","x":"First, many of our businesses have inflation-linked revenues, pricing power and resilient demand for essential products and services, which they provide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/12/brookfield-bn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2026-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Goodman","x":"In office, demand for premier space remains very strong and combined with limited new supply continues to drive pricing power in rents across our portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/12/brookfield-bn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BN 2026 Q3","e":"bn","d":"2026-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Goodman","x":"And as those financings do come up for restructuring, for refinancing, it can create attractive investment opportunities for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/12/brookfield-bn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[62,1,5220,0,0,0,3497,553],[63,1,6292,0,0,0,3649,2336],[64,1,8656,0,0,0,7646,235],[65,1,8475,0,0,0,6011,0],[66,1,9018,0,0,0,5912,2665],[67,1,8021,0,0,0,6764,939]],"cinema":[[62,1,5220,0,0,0,3497,553],[63,1,6292,0,0,0,3649,2336],[64,1,8656,0,0,0,7646,235],[65,1,8475,0,0,0,6011,0],[66,1,9018,0,0,0,5912,2665],[67,1,8021,0,0,0,6764,939]],"imax":[[62,1,5220,0,0,0,3497,553],[63,1,6292,0,0,0,3649,2336],[64,1,8656,0,0,0,7646,235],[65,1,8475,0,0,0,6011,0],[66,1,9018,0,0,0,5912,2665],[67,1,8021,0,0,0,6764,939]],"streaming":[[62,1,5220,0,0,0,3497,553],[63,1